## Responsive Design Evidence

### Testing Methodology

| Device | Screen Width | Breakpoint |
|--------|--------------|------------|
| Desktop | > 768px | Full layout, horizontal navigation |
| Tablet | 768px | Single column, hamburger menu |
| Mobile | 480px | Single column, smaller fonts, hamburger menu |

### How to Test

1. Open website in Chrome
2. Press F12 to open DevTools
3. Click the Device Toolbar icon (Ctrl+Shift+M)
4. Select different devices to test responsiveness

